    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "The recipe covers rank one through rank five and carries a high price. Refinement difficulty is not high, but the procedures are many and costly, including a step that needs large numbers of fresh beast skins. Within days Fang Yuan has received about ten thousand rank one copies and still judges that amount far short of a push to rank five.",
        "chapters": [
          517
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "rank-and-early-stock",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_refinement"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "He later holds three rank four lurking soul coat Gu. With that concealment, as long as he does not use over eighty percent of his strength, his soul fluctuations stay covered.",
        "chapters": [
          526
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "rank-four-limit",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Full-strength use of a strong mutated wolf trump card would break that rank four cover and expose him as a target. He asks Hei Lou Lan for a rank five copy because fusing his three rank four Gu has too low a success rate.",
        "chapters": [
          527
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "rank-four-limit",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Hei Lou Lan confirms the rank five lurking soul coat Gu is in Fang Yuan’s hands with a mutated beast wolf group. Fang Yuan hides on a blood forest wolf cloaked in that Gu, described as a green-grey wolf skin cape, and the Gu conceals his soul so he can strike with full strength.",
        "chapters": [
          532
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "rank-five-on-the-battlefield",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
